<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
<title>Product Release Note</title>
<style>
  @page { size: A4; margin: 0; }
  .page {
    width: 794px; height: 1123px;
    padding: 50px 60px; box-sizing: border-box;
    overflow: hidden; page-break-after: always;
    position: relative;
    font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif; /* Using serif fonts as primary */
  }
  .page:last-child { page-break-after: auto; }
  h1, h2, h3 { font-family: "DejaVu Sans", "Liberation Sans", Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; }
  .header-info { font-size: 10pt; color: #555; }
  .section-title { font-size: 14pt; font-weight: bold; margin-top: 20px; margin-bottom: 10px; }
  .content-block { line-height: 1.5; font-size: 10pt; }
  .two-column { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: 40px; }
  .column { flex: 1; }
  ul { list-style-type: disc; margin-left: 20px; padding-left: 0; }
  li { margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 10pt; }
  .icon-section { display: flex; gap: 30px; margin-top: 20px; }
  .icon-item { text-align: center; font-size: 10pt; }
  .icon-item .icon { font-size: 24pt; margin-bottom: 5px; }
  .footer { position: absolute; bottom: 0; left: 0; right: 0; padding: 20px 60px; font-size: 8pt; color: #777; text-align: center; }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="page">
  <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start;">
    <div style="font-size: 24pt; font-weight: bold; color: #CC0000;">ABB</div>
    <div class="header-info" style="text-align: right;">
      SURGE PROTECTIVE DEVICES | RELEASE NOTE, {{ release_date }}
    </div>
  </div>

  <h1 style="font-size: 24pt; font-weight: bold; margin-top: 30px;">OVR PV Type 2 Surge Protective Devices</h1>
  <h2 style="font-size: 16pt; font-weight: normal; margin-top: 5px;">Protect photovoltaic systems and help improve performance</h2>

  <div class="two-column" style="margin-top: 40px;">
    <div class="column" style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center;">
      <!-- Placeholder for image -->
      <div style="width: 250px; height: 350px; border: 1px solid #ccc; background-color: #f0f0f0; display: flex; justify-content: center; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 20px;">
        [Product Image Placeholder]
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="column">
      <div class="content-block">
        <p>ABB launches the OVR PV Type 2 SPDs for Photovoltaic applications. These SPDs help divert the lightning currents within an electrical system resulting from indirect lightning events. Their effective voltage protection ratings keep damaging voltage peaks from exceeding the withstand voltages of the protected equipment.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="icon-section" style="margin-top: 60px;">
    <div class="icon-item">
      <div class="icon">&#9989;</div> <!-- Checkmark icon placeholder -->
      <div class="content-block">
        <h3 style="font-size: 11pt; font-weight: bold;">Benefits</h3>
        <ul>
          <li><span data-field="benefits.extended_lifetime">{{ benefits.extended_lifetime }}</span>: Safety Reserve system with two varistors per line extend protection lifetime</li>
          <li><span data-field="benefits.easy_replacement">{{ benefits.easy_replacement }}</span>: Pluggable cartridge for easy replacement during maintenance</li>
          <li><span data-field="benefits.faster_wiring">{{ benefits.faster_wiring }}</span>: OVR T2 use the same terminal as Pro M compact devices to offer complete coordination and time-saving in wiring operation</li>
          <li><span data-field="benefits.easy_identification">{{ benefits.easy_identification }}</span>: Clear information on the front of the product indicating the technical characteristics of the OVR</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="icon-item">
      <div class="icon">&#9733;</div> <!-- Star icon placeholder -->
      <div class="content-block">
        <h3 style="font-size: 11pt; font-weight: bold;">Features</h3>
        <ul>
          <li><span data-field="features.protection_mode">{{ features.protection_mode }}</span>: DC+ to DC- / DC+ to G / DC- to G</li>
          <li><span data-field="features.protected_lines">{{ features.protected_lines }}</span>: 2</li>
          <li><span data-field="features.technology">{{ features.technology }}</span>: Thermally protected varistor</li>
          <li><span data-field="features.bi_color_end">{{ features.bi_color_end }}</span> (green=functional / red=replace)</li>
          <li><span data-field="features.compact_design">{{ features.compact_design }}</span></li>
          <li><span data-field="features.auxiliary_contact">{{ features.auxiliary_contact }}</span></li>
          <li><span data-field="features.pluggable_cartridge">{{ features.pluggable_cartridge }}</span></li>
          <li><span data-field="features.bottom_wiring">{{ features.bottom_wiring }}</span></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="two-column" style="margin-top: 50px;">
    <div class="column" style="flex: 1;">
      <div class="section-title">Technical specifications</div>
      <div class="content-block">
        <ul>
          <li>L+, L- protection</li>
          <li>Self protected up to Iscpv, Sccr = 10kA</li>
          <li>Uc = 1000, 1500 VDC</li>
          <li>In = 20kA (1000V), 15kA (1500V)</li>
          <li>Up = 4 kV (1000V), 5 (1500V)</li>
          <li>Vpr = 3 kV (1000V), 4 (1500V)</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="column" style="flex: 1;">
      <div class="section-title">Sales ordering</div>
      <div class="content-block">
        <ul>
          <li>ABB empower</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="section-title" style="margin-top: 30px;">Available</div>
      <div class="content-block">
        <p>Available for ordering starting <span data-field="available_date">{{ available_date }}</span>. For lead times, refer to empower.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="section-title" style="margin-top: 30px;">Downloadable resources</div>
      <div class="content-block">
        <ul>
          <li>OVR PV T2 40-1000 P - Datasheet</li>
          <li>OVR PV T2 40-1500 P - Datasheet</li>
          <li>OVR PV T2 40-1500 P - Datasheet</li>
          <li>OVR PV T2 40-1500 P - Datasheet</li>
          <li>Installation instructions</li>
          <li>System Pro M™ Catalog</li>
          <li>BuyLog - Section 5</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="section-title" style="margin-top: 30px;">Contact information</div>
      <div class="content-block">
        <p>Product Marketing Manager</p>
        <p><span data-field="contact_name">{{ contact_name }}</span></p>
        <p><span data-field="contact_email">{{ contact_email }}</span></p>
      </div>
      <div class="section-title" style="margin-top: 30px;">Scan QR code for additional information</div>
      <div class="content-block" style="text-align: center; margin-top: 15px;">
        <!-- QR Code Placeholder -->
        <div style="width: 100px; height: 100px; border: 1px solid #000;">[QR Code Placeholder]</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="two-column" style="margin-top: 50px;">
    <div class="column" style="flex: 1;">
      <div class="section-title">Standards and certifications</div>
      <div class="content-block">
        <ul>
          <li>IEC 61643-31</li>
          <li>UL 1449 5th ed</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="column" style="flex: 1;">
      <div class="section-title">Applications</div>
      <div class="content-block">
        <p>Photovoltaic applications such as:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>String/combiner boxes</li>
          <li>PV inverter</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="section-title" style="margin-top: 30px;">Additional PV SPDs may be required for optimal protection if cable lengths between SPDs are greater than 10 meters.</div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="two-column" style="margin-top: 50px;">
    <div class="column" style="flex: 1;">
      <div class="section-title">Channel</div>
      <div class="content-block">
        <ul>
          <li>OEMs - Panel builders</li>
          <li>OEMs - Renewable applications</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="column" style="flex: 1;">
      <div class="section-title">Product warranty</div>
      <div class="content-block">
        <p>1-year</p>
      </div>
      <div class="section-title" style="margin-top: 30px;">Country of origin</div>
      <div class="content-block">
        <p>{{ country_of_origin }}</p>
      </div>
      <div class="section-title" style="margin-top: 30px;">Target market</div>
      <div class="content-block">
        <p>{{ target_market }}</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

</div>

<div class="page">
  <div class="footer">
    ABB Inc. <span data-field="address">{{ address }}</span>. <span data-field="website">{{ website }}</span>.
    <br>
    We reserve the right to make technical changes without prior notice. With regard to this document, we are not liable for any errors or omissions.
    <br>
    We reserve all rights in this document and in the content therein. Any reproduction, distribution, or use of this document or its contents in whole or in parts is forbidden without prior written consent of ABB.
    <br>
    © {{ current_year }} ABB All rights reserved.
  </div>
</div>

</body>
</html>